<section class="vsr">
  <header class="vsr__hero">
    <p>Vanaya Naturals Pvt Ltd</p>
    <h1>Shipping & Returns</h1>
    <div class="vsr__rule"><span>✦</span></div>
    <div class="vsr__lede">Thoughtfully packed. Carefully delivered.<br>Because every Vanaya ritual should arrive beautifully.</div>
  </header>

  <div class="vsr__rates">
    <article><span>PREPAID ORDERS BELOW ₹999</span><strong>₹59</strong><small>Standard shipping across serviceable India</small></article>
    <article class="vsr__featured"><span>PREPAID ORDERS ₹999 & ABOVE</span><strong>Complimentary</strong><small>Free standard shipping across serviceable India</small></article>
  </div>

  <div class="vsr__body">
    <section><p class="vsr__kicker">The journey to you</p><h2>Delivery, with care</h2><p>Orders are processed with care by Vanaya Naturals Pvt Ltd and handed to our delivery partners after quality and packing checks. Once dispatched, tracking details are shared on the contact details provided with your order.</p><div class="vsr__steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Order received</h3><p>Your order enters our fulfilment queue.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Prepared & packed</h3><p>Each ritual is checked and securely packed.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Dispatched</h3><p>Tracking is shared once the parcel leaves us.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>Delivered</h3><p>Your Vanaya ritual arrives at your doorstep.</p></div></div></section>

    <section class="vsr__split"><div><p class="vsr__kicker">Delivery timeline</p><h2>When to expect your order</h2><p>Most orders are generally delivered within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> after dispatch in major serviceable locations. Remote locations, high-volume periods, public holidays or circumstances outside the courier partner's control may require additional time.</p><p>Please enter a complete address, correct PIN code and reachable mobile number at checkout to help avoid delivery delays.</p></div><aside><span>GOOD TO KNOW</span><p>Shipping charges and the available delivery method are shown at checkout before payment. Complimentary shipping applies to eligible prepaid orders of ₹999 and above.</p></aside></section>

    <section class="vsr__split vsr__split--reverse"><div><p class="vsr__kicker">Returns & concerns</p><h2>If something isn't right</h2><p>Because skincare and personal-care products are hygiene-sensitive, opened or used products cannot ordinarily be returned. If your order arrives damaged, incorrect, tampered with, or has a genuine fulfilment issue, please contact Vanaya promptly with your order details and clear photographs/video of the parcel and product.</p><p>Eligible cases are reviewed by our customer-care team in accordance with the applicable return/refund policy. Any approved replacement or resolution remains subject to verification.</p></div><aside><span>IMPORTANT</span><p>Please do not accept a visibly damaged or tampered parcel where refusal is possible. Keep the original packaging until your concern has been reviewed.</p></aside></section>

    <section class="vsr__faq">
      <p class="vsr__kicker">A little more clarity</p>
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="vsr__faqintro">Everything you may want to know about your Vanaya order, delivery and after-delivery care.</p>
      <div class="vsr__faqlist">
        <details><summary>How soon will my order be dispatched?</summary><p>Orders are generally prepared and dispatched within 24–48 business hours after confirmation. During launches, promotions, festive periods or public holidays, preparation may take a little longer.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How can I track my Vanaya order?</summary><p>Once your order is dispatched, tracking details are shared on your registered contact details. You can also review your order status from the My Account section on vanayaveda.com.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Why has my order not been shipped yet?</summary><p>We prepare every order carefully before handover to our delivery partner. Weekends, public holidays, high-order periods or operational delays can occasionally extend dispatch timelines.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can delivery take longer than the estimated timeline?</summary><p>Yes. Remote locations, severe weather, seasonal demand, public holidays and courier-network disruptions can sometimes cause delays beyond the estimated delivery window.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I change my address or contact number after placing an order?</summary><p>Please contact Vanaya Care as soon as possible. Once an order has entered processing or has been handed over to the courier, we may not be able to change the delivery address or contact details.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What should I do if my package arrives damaged or tampered with?</summary><p>Please retain the packaging and contact Vanaya Care promptly at sales@vanayaveda.com with your order number, clear photographs and, where possible, an unboxing video so our team can review the concern.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What if an item is missing or I receive the wrong product?</summary><p>Contact us promptly at sales@vanayaveda.com with your order number and photographs of the parcel and products received. Our team will verify the shipment and assist with the appropriate resolution.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I return or exchange a product?</summary><p>For hygiene, safety and product-integrity reasons, beauty and personal-care products may have restrictions on returns and exchanges. Any eligible resolution will be handled in accordance with Vanaya’s published return, replacement and cancellation policy.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How do I contact Vanaya about an order?</summary><p>Email sales@vanayaveda.com with your order number and details of your concern. This helps our team locate your order and assist you faster.</p></details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="vsr__note"><p>Need help with an order?</p><h2>We are here for your ritual.</h2><a href="/pages/contact">Contact Vanaya Care <span>→</span></a></section>
  </div>
</section>
